Tefsiri: Ar-Room 30:57 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"O gün zulmedenlere özürleri bir yarar sağlamaz, onlardan artık (Allah&#x27;ı) razı edecek bir şey yapmaları da istenmez.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Ana sayfa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sûre Ar-Room\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/30.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Âyet 57\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/30-57.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/30.html\">Sûre Ar-Room</a> › Âyet 57</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Ar-Room 30:57</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فَيَوْمَئِذٍ لَّا يَنفَعُ الَّذِينَ ظَلَمُوا مَعْذِرَتُهُمْ وَلَا هُمْ يُسْتَعْتَبُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">O gün zulmedenlere özürleri bir yarar sağlamaz, onlardan artık (Allah&#x27;ı) razı edecek bir şey yapmaları da istenmez.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>İmam İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فلا يطلب منهم يوم القيامة أن يعتبوا ربهم فيزيلوا عتبه بطاعته واتباع رسله وكذلك قوله: {فيومئذ لا ينفع الذين ظلموا معذرتهم ولا هم يستعتبون}<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 4/181</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s30a57\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/30-54.html\">Önceki âyet (30:54)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/30-60.html\">Sonraki âyet (30:60)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/30-60.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: Ar-Room 30:60 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"O halde sabret muhakkak ki Allah’ın vaadi haktır. Kesin imana sahip olmayanlar sakın seni gevşekliğe sevk etmesin.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/30-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/30-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/30-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/30-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/30-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/30-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/30-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/30-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/30-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/30-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/30-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/30-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/30-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/30-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/30-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/30-60.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/30-60.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: Ar-Room 30:60 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"O halde sabret muhakkak ki Allah’ın vaadi haktır. Kesin imana sahip olmayanlar sakın seni gevşekliğe sevk etmesin.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Ana sayfa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sûre Ar-Room\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/30.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Âyet 60\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/30-60.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/30.html\">Sûre Ar-Room</a> › Âyet 60</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre Ar-Room 30:60</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فَاصْبِرْ إِنَّ وَعْدَ اللَّهِ حَقٌّ وَلَا يَسْتَخِفَّنَّكَ الَّذِينَ لَا يُوقِنُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">O halde sabret muhakkak ki Allah’ın vaadi haktır. Kesin imana sahip olmayanlar sakın seni gevşekliğe sevk etmesin.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>İmam İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فمن وفى الصبر حقه، وتيقن أن وعد الله حق لم يستفزه المبطلون، ولم يستخفه الذين لا يوقنون<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 3/204</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ومتى ضعف صبره ويقينه أو كلاهما استفزه هؤلاء واستخفه هؤلاء، فجذبوه إليهم بحسب ضعف قوة صبره ويقينه، فكلما ضعف ذلك منه قوي جذبهم له، وكلما قوي صبره ويقينه قوي انجذابه منهم وجذبه لهم.<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 3/204</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s30a60\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/30-57.html\">Önceki âyet (30:57)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}